; Wheel visual roots, IN THE SAME ORDER as box_spec.tres's wheel_positions (L/R per axle, front
; bogie axle first) — TowedBody pairs them by index and errors on a count mismatch. RayWheel
; overwrites each root's transform every tick, so the radius scale and the right-side flip ride the
; INSTANCED CHILD. The flip is about Vector3.RIGHT, never UP: in the frame RayWheel builds, the
; wheel's local Y is the AXLE, so a yaw would just spin it about its own axis.
